---
import "../../../styles/tool-studio.css";
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ScoringResearchWorkbench from "../../../components/ScoringResearchWorkbench.astro";
import SourceDisclosure from "../../../components/SourceDisclosure.astro";
import { scoringCapability } from "../../../lib/scoring-capability";
import "../../../styles/tools.css";
---

<BaseLayout title="歌曲计算">
<div class="tool-studio" data-tool-kind="song-calculator">

  <section class="catalog-section scoring-research-section">
    <div class="content-shell">
      <ScoringResearchWorkbench />
    </div>
  </section>
  {scoringCapability.calculatorEnabled && <section class="catalog-section catalog-section--tight">
    <div class="content-shell">
    <SourceDisclosure>
      <p>计算依据已收录的卡牌、歌曲、谱面和技能资料，结合你设置的养成与加成，估算整首歌的分数。</p>
      <p>默认按全部音符获得 Perfect、满生命且不开启辅助来计算。技能发动顺序会影响分数，页面会给出平均分与分数范围。</p>
      <p>结果仅供比较队伍与养成方案，尚不能保证与游戏实得分数完全一致。部分同时出现的音符和技能效果仍可能有差异；规则尚未确认的活动暂不支持计算。</p>
    </SourceDisclosure>
    </div>
  </section>}
</div>
</BaseLayout>
